{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/2f1d9766b6037b10446e5b45ca846fe9.poster.avif?t=1771047675\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/2f1d9766b6037b10446e5b45ca846fe9.webm?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/2f1d9766b6037b10446e5b45ca846fe9.mp4?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robo Frenzy is a sandbox boss-battling game where you slay bosses and create them. Defeat massive robos, customize them, and unleash the ultimate boss for the world to fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INFINITE BOSSES, INFINITE STRATEGIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/6e723aa8edb087e5b0c01d9d2ab2bca1.poster.avif?t=1771047675\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/6e723aa8edb087e5b0c01d9d2ab2bca1.webm?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/6e723aa8edb087e5b0c01d9d2ab2bca1.mp4?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start slicing away at a laser shooting, flying desktop computer with a sword and then in mid-battle craft a chicken grenade launcher to change your strategy. Robo Frenzy\u2019s dynamic multi-weapon system gives players an arsenal at their fingertips to face the game\u2019s army of bosses. Quickly construct machines like cannons you can load with any weapon and springy bumpers in the heat of battle to fend off foes. Your arsenal is your imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREATE A UNIVERSE OF BOSS FIGHTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/0ba64b3923af5e40448126085ea08c53.poster.avif?t=1771047675\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/0ba64b3923af5e40448126085ea08c53.webm?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/0ba64b3923af5e40448126085ea08c53.mp4?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can crush bosses or capture them and bring them back to your lab. Equip your robos with parts from fallen foes. Hats, accessories, and stickers give robos style and new abilities. You can even reprogram how robo attacks by changing a simple shield bash into a teleporting shield strike or a combo attack that summons a tsunami before striking. Unleash your inner mad scientist to design the boss battle of your dreams\u2026 and everyone else\u2019s nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/b9f62cdebd22f800def7559400790bf0.poster.avif?t=1771047675\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/b9f62cdebd22f800def7559400790bf0.webm?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/b9f62cdebd22f800def7559400790bf0.mp4?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHARE AND CHALLENGE THE WORLD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/7c21ef98cc0965b2b20d5b44ff038c26.poster.avif?t=1771047675\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/7c21ef98cc0965b2b20d5b44ff038c26.webm?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/7c21ef98cc0965b2b20d5b44ff038c26.mp4?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss you build can be easily shared with a cross-platform password system. Post a code on Discord, drop it in a Twitch chat, or send it to a friend. Your custom boss is instantly ready for the world to fight. The only rule is you have to beat your creation first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TEAM UP IN CO-OP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/0f12863e88a47e59ca4208fccdb90fe9.poster.avif?t=1771047675\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/0f12863e88a47e59ca4208fccdb90fe9.webm?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/0f12863e88a47e59ca4208fccdb90fe9.mp4?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the entire campaign in local co-op! Join forces with a friend to beatdown bosses and scavenge parts to make an unstoppable boss together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN THE BATTLE BUILDERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/87fb92e0628618ae1c7c8facedf216f3.poster.avif?t=1771047675\" width=600 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/87fb92e0628618ae1c7c8facedf216f3.webm?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/87fb92e0628618ae1c7c8facedf216f3.mp4?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be part of our growing community! Share your creations, fight other players\u2019 bosses, and help shape the future of Robo Frenzy. Join our Discord today.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2324550?t=1771047675","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771047675","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771047675","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771047675","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/2f1d9766b6037b10446e5b45ca846fe9.poster.avif?t=1771047675\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/2f1d9766b6037b10446e5b45ca846fe9.webm?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/2f1d9766b6037b10446e5b45ca846fe9.mp4?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robo Frenzy is a sandbox boss-battling game where you slay bosses and create them. Defeat massive robos, customize them, and unleash the ultimate boss for the world to fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INFINITE BOSSES, INFINITE STRATEGIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/6e723aa8edb087e5b0c01d9d2ab2bca1.poster.avif?t=1771047675\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/6e723aa8edb087e5b0c01d9d2ab2bca1.webm?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/6e723aa8edb087e5b0c01d9d2ab2bca1.mp4?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start slicing away at a laser shooting, flying desktop computer with a sword and then in mid-battle craft a chicken grenade launcher to change your strategy. Robo Frenzy\u2019s dynamic multi-weapon system gives players an arsenal at their fingertips to face the game\u2019s army of bosses. Quickly construct machines like cannons you can load with any weapon and springy bumpers in the heat of battle to fend off foes. Your arsenal is your imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREATE A UNIVERSE OF BOSS FIGHTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/0ba64b3923af5e40448126085ea08c53.poster.avif?t=1771047675\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/0ba64b3923af5e40448126085ea08c53.webm?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/0ba64b3923af5e40448126085ea08c53.mp4?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can crush bosses or capture them and bring them back to your lab. Equip your robos with parts from fallen foes. Hats, accessories, and stickers give robos style and new abilities. You can even reprogram how robo attacks by changing a simple shield bash into a teleporting shield strike or a combo attack that summons a tsunami before striking. Unleash your inner mad scientist to design the boss battle of your dreams\u2026 and everyone else\u2019s nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/b9f62cdebd22f800def7559400790bf0.poster.avif?t=1771047675\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/b9f62cdebd22f800def7559400790bf0.webm?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/b9f62cdebd22f800def7559400790bf0.mp4?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHARE AND CHALLENGE THE WORLD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/7c21ef98cc0965b2b20d5b44ff038c26.poster.avif?t=1771047675\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/7c21ef98cc0965b2b20d5b44ff038c26.webm?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/7c21ef98cc0965b2b20d5b44ff038c26.mp4?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss you build can be easily shared with a cross-platform password system. Post a code on Discord, drop it in a Twitch chat, or send it to a friend. Your custom boss is instantly ready for the world to fight. The only rule is you have to beat your creation first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TEAM UP IN CO-OP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/0f12863e88a47e59ca4208fccdb90fe9.poster.avif?t=1771047675\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/0f12863e88a47e59ca4208fccdb90fe9.webm?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/0f12863e88a47e59ca4208fccdb90fe9.mp4?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the entire campaign in local co-op! Join forces with a friend to beatdown bosses and scavenge parts to make an unstoppable boss together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN THE BATTLE BUILDERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/87fb92e0628618ae1c7c8facedf216f3.poster.avif?t=1771047675\" width=600 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/87fb92e0628618ae1c7c8facedf216f3.webm?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/extras/87fb92e0628618ae1c7c8facedf216f3.mp4?t=1771047675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be part of our growing community! Share your creations, fight other players\u2019 bosses, and help shape the future of Robo Frenzy. Join our Discord today.</p>","developers":["YummyYummyTummy","Tamatin Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324550/header.jpg?t=1771047675","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2324550/621889257/1353e